# Golden: roadmap 9100 feel-genre swing pass — "shuffle" style, varD (peak
# Texas shuffle), one held Cmaj7. Locks the engine-driven swing (implementer
# spec docs/proposals/per-style-feel-swing-reauthoring.md): the closed-hat
# off-8ths now sit on the straight grid (steps 2/6/10/14) and groove::apply
# pushes them late by (480*72)/300 = 115 ticks, landing at 595/1555/2515/3475.
# On-beats (steps 0/4/8/12) stay at exact step*240 (0/960/1920/2880) — the
# groove offset is zero there. This golden is the regression guard for that
# feel: any accidental change to shuffle.hpp's .groove or its re-authored drum
# table would move these ticks and fail this test.
key C major
port open out virt as synth
chord out synth:4
style load shuffle
style route drums synth:10
play C
style section varD
transport start
advance 3840
quit
